{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶大家穿梭不同地區尋覓人氣美食。首站由美食KOL Arthur夥拍倪嘉雯深入紅磡住宅區，體驗一間水準絕不亞於中環、CP值極高的Omakase。用餐前大廚先呈上產自北海道利尻島的「利尻海膽」，因海膽長期以利尻昆布為食，肉質極致鮮甜濃郁且全無腥味。隨後有以鹹香酥脆炸海苔包裹清甜海膽、頂層點綴黑松露碎的「海苔松露海膽卷」。「磯煮鮑魚」則採用日本常用的「波浪切法」，使切面呈現均勻的凹凸波浪紋以鎖住並沾滿濃郁肝醬。同場更供應軟滑入味的「櫻煮八爪魚」及外皮烤至像薯片般酥脆的「靜岡縣烤鰻魚」。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>店舖名稱：</strong> 榛 Hashibami</p></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"42bdbaee-4ace-4cc4-9215-cbe8552e1c72.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026aN8mkAlWq51788513054.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"42bdbaee-4ace-4cc4-9215-cbe8552e1c72.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"97631962-dd8c-4129-bed6-2315e1bde072.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026bhtvQEmFKA1788513056.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"97631962-dd8c-4129-bed6-2315e1bde072.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dab305fc-f2b8-4a11-99ee-8eab8799b81d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026vHk3teN4hz1788513056.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dab305fc-f2b8-4a11-99ee-8eab8799b81d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f88ae1d7-909b-4ff1-bfc7-85f9a3f50bfd.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026g8Xcv5mYck1788513056.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f88ae1d7-909b-4ff1-bfc7-85f9a3f50bfd.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由伍倩彤帶領黃嘉雯前往灣仔，造訪專為香港人口味改良、主打健康輕盈特色菜的新派菲律賓Fusion餐廳。「太陽蛋配豬脊肉」改以豬頸肉和香脆豬皮取代部分傳統內臟，配搭低卡的「香蒜椰菜花飯」清新不油膩。另一道「花生醬燉菜」利用烘烤花生及炒糯米粉熬製，鹹甜交織十分開胃。「香蒜美國牛小排」加入喼汁與香蒜，微酸清爽平衡了油脂。甜點「自家製雪糕三文治」提供香芋或牛油果風味，外層包覆溫熱的斑斕蛋糕，帶來冰火交融的口感。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>店舖名稱：</strong> Holy Gaw</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址：</strong> 灣仔汕頭街15號地下4號舖</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8bb4117c-7284-42c4-b8f4-22695fe962b3.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026qIHncL5QpO1788513055.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8bb4117c-7284-42c4-b8f4-22695fe962b3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7c4984b0-2e31-4c17-afeb-a4d8f47de273.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026qoSvKVnzMi1788513055.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7c4984b0-2e31-4c17-afeb-a4d8f47de273.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ccc35579-8219-41b1-a8a3-adde36d1496d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026OKZDEzUOtV1788513058.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ccc35579-8219-41b1-a8a3-adde36d1496d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3ee0d066-397c-43ad-a340-e39c3516cdda.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026YLz26v6UGX1788513057.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3ee0d066-397c-43ad-a340-e39c3516cdda.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">最後，施焯日與陳若思前往上環探索人氣手工雪糕店的消暑打卡甜品。焦點推介造型極具巧思的「火焰仔」，外層蛋白霜經火焰槍微噴至焦香、口感如棉花糖般綿密，內裡包覆菠蘿、芒果與白朱古力，配搭細滑雪糕與底層蛋糕，層次豐富。另一款「THE DOT 閃亮糖珠雪糕蛋糕杯」則鋪滿繽紛閃亮糖珠，是今夏必備的打卡良品。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址：</strong> 上環歌賦街18號地下（地舖）</p></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3737e105-d75d-4dbe-8ee8-73d84b7cce27.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026zMejKPnmri1788513057.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3737e105-d75d-4dbe-8ee8-73d84b7cce27.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f0a25324-43b9-4307-a3b0-966145c6c1c1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026uAKutRvo631788513057.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f0a25324-43b9-4307-a3b0-966145c6c1c1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T13:19:49.107816+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":675,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}